We thank the reviewer for their time and valuable suggestions.

1. We are hoping to be able to put together an open source notebook later (separate from the paper), to help people use this dataset in their research. Other ML methods suggested by the reviewer will indeed be useful additions to such a notebook.\
&nbsp;
2. We use one-hot encoding (using pandas get_dummies()) to process categorical variables for the classification task.\
&nbsp;
3. The performance metrics are measured by training and testing the model multiple times with different random samples from the dataset, and confidence intervals are calculated from these measurements.

